 "transcript": [
  "[action] (to the eldest son, the second son) Wang Lung looks at his sons and then at Pear Blossom.",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) The second son returns home.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"We are setting up a great store and we will make a great deal of money out of it.\"",
  "[silence] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung says nothing.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"We will sell out the lands and buy silver and gold and we will not be poor again,\"",
  "[action] Eldest son moves away from father with a mixture of anger and hatred",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) The second son leaves with his brother.",
  "Wang Lung: \"Well, and those are my sons and they are my flesh and blood and yet they will not sit under the sun with an old man and I am their father!\"",
  "[action] Wang Lung goes to his room and lies on his bed.",
  "[says] (to the second son) Eldest son invites brother to join family for dinner",
  "the eldest son (to the second son): \"Well, and it is a long time since we have sat together as brothers in the great hall and it is not fit that we should eat in the kitchen as servants.\"",
  "[action] Wang Lung hears the noise and goes to the great hall.",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung sits beside his eldest son.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Well, and what is it, my son?\"",
  "[says] Eldest son complains about wife",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"She is a cold woman and she does not love me and she says to me, 'You are not worthy of me, you are but a poor man's son.'\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"You have a good house and a good bed and food at your table every day. What more can a man have?\"",
  "[action] Eldest son looks at father with pride",
  "[action] The eldest son turns his head away from his father.",
  "[says] Eldest son responds proudly"
